in Lojban... especially if you're "strict" about it
as I tend to be.

How about it? Can someone come up with a couple of good
lines of iambic pentameter, a nice heroic couplet maybe?

I'm not too picky about male vs. female endings as long
as they are mostly correct and there are not many extra
syllables in the middle.


